26. ~ WestpacComAu::Transactions.download_csv_file: Takes username:, password:, period:, from_date:, to_date: and web_account_options:, and returns the name of the file downloaded. The account is shut down even where the download fails.
27. - WestpacComAu::Transactions.csv_filename: Use name of the file being downloaded.
